list.item:
that as soon as the new Government has been formed it should declare: (i)
that the National Liberation Committee will be extended to include members of the last Yugoslav Skupstina who have not compromised themselves by collaboration with the enemy, thus forming a body to be known as a temporary Parliament and (ii)
that legislative acts passed by the National Liberation Committee will be subject to subsequent ratification by a Constituent Assembly;

